  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "MoEngage has given you an array AAA consisting of NNN positive integers.\n\nYou should perform QQQ queries of the following two types:\n\n\n111 iii XXX : Set AiA_iAi​ to XXX.\n222 LLL RRR : Find the **minimum** non-negative integer KKK such that the sequence [∣AL−K∣,∣AL+1−K∣,…,∣AR−1−K∣,∣AR−K∣][|A_L - K|, |A_{L+1} - K|, \\ldots, |A_{R-1} - K|, |A_R - K|][∣AL​−K∣,∣AL+1​−K∣,…,∣AR−1​−K∣,∣AR​−K∣] is sorted in **non-decreasing** order. Print −1-1−1 if no such KKK exists.\nFor each query of type 222, output the **minimum** non-negative integer KKK satisfying the constraint, or −1-1−1 if there isn't any.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains two integers N,QN, QN,Q.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\nThen, the ithi^{th}ith of the next QQQ lines contains three integers describing the queries 111 iii XXX or 222 LLL RRR.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each query of type 222, output the **minimum** integer KKK satisfying the constraint, or −1-1−1 if there isn't any in a new line.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤N,Q≤2⋅1051 \\leq N, Q \\leq 2\\cdot 10^51≤N,Q≤2⋅105",
      "0≤Ai,X≤1090 \\leq A_i, X \\leq 10^90≤Ai​,X≤109",
      "1≤L≤R≤N1 \\leq L \\leq R \\leq N1≤L≤R≤N"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "5 7\n5 3 2 6 0\n2 1 5\n1 2 7\n2 1 5\n1 4 2\n2 1 5\n1 2 5\n2 1 2",
        "output": "4\n-1\n5\n0",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nIn the first query, selecting K=4K=4K=4 makes the sequence [∣A1−K∣,∣A2−K∣,∣A3−K∣,∣A4−K∣,∣A5−K∣]=[1,1,2,2,4][|A_1 - K|, |A_2 - K|, |A_3 - K|, |A_4 - K|, |A_5 - K|] = [1, 1, 2, 2, 4][∣A1​−K∣,∣A2​−K∣,∣A3​−K∣,∣A4​−K∣,∣A5​−K∣]=[1,1,2,2,4]. This sequence is sorted in non-decreasing order. Also, there exists no value of KKK less than 444 satisfying this.\n\n\nIn the second query, change A2=7A_2 = 7A2​=7. After the second query, the array AAA becomes [5,7,2,6,0][5, 7, 2, 6, 0][5,7,2,6,0].\n\n\nIn the third query, there exists no value of KKK satisfying the constraints."
      }
